Contract coverage
Configuration tests use parse_and_validate_config(), load_config() and validate_config().
They retain required fields, defaults, malformed/trailing input, unknown/duplicate
key policies, range limits, diagnostics and file-relative output paths.
Ticker tests use parse_ticker_message() for filtering, nonterminated frame views,
exact prices and IDs, escaped text, malformed fields and typed domain errors.
No tests directly deserialize Config or TickerUpdate through Glaze metadata.
Numeric tests include 16,000 randomized window updates against an independent
exact reference, 1,000 generated price round trips and ties-to-even CSV rounding.
Local TLS/application tests retain trust verification, deadlines, signals,
first-error propagation, batching, final flushing and sink interchangeability.

